  M3.journal.use narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    The manager's last entry: "Sluice shut for the night. Lever on the nail. Gone home." Last year's date. Below: "Drain one notch at a time and wait, or the banks will give way." The water needed for milling is marked, too.
  M3.journal.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    The office ledgers lie open.
  M3.clamp.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    A sound clamp on the manager's desk.
  M3.gauge.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    A measuring staff stands in the water outside the window. It shows the level in the pond.
  M3.answer.prompt narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    How can I persuade Pavel?
  M4.gate.key narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    The lever fits into the winch's socket.
  M4.gate.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    The pond sluice: a winch and a notched arc. The ledger says: open one notch at a time, then wait for the water to fall.
  M4.gate.locked narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    I can't turn the winch without its lever. The sluice lever is in the office.
  M4.gate.tarred narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Agata greases the winch's axle with tar. The winch creaks — and turns.
  M4.water.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Water in the channel by the sluice. The mill pond holds it back.
  O4.exit_O2.closed narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    The school path is buried knee-deep in snow. I can't get through alone.
  O3.clock.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Mama's wall clock. Its pendulum swings steadily, without hurry.
  O3.dunya_mirror.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    A little mirror in a wooden frame. It doesn't show the parlour — it shows Dunya's stove. And the armchair.
  O3.window.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Snow outside. Twenty winters spent apart. This is the first we'll share.
  O3.icon.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    An embroidered towel hangs by the icon, and the little oil lamp is lit.
  O1d.ulyana.prompt narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    What shall I ask Ulyana?
  O4.mitya.prompt narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    What shall I talk to Mitya about?
  O2d.mitten_path.take narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Agata picks up her mitten without a word. Beyond the gate, the path leads home now.
  O2d.mitten_path.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    The mitten lies where Agata left it. But beyond the gate, the road has changed.
  O4.mitya_board.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    A little notched board — Mitya's.
  O4.mitya_board.prompt narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    What should happen to the board?
  O4.letters_bag.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    A year's worth of letters. The sack is almost empty.
  O4.letters_bag.prompt narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    How will Aksinya get her letters now?
  O3.nina.ribbon narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Mama's ribbon. Nina weaves it into Agata's braid without a word — as she used to on feast days.
  O1q.village_map.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Nina has hung up the school map of Olkhovka for the lesson.
  O1q.village_map.prompt narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Where should the tracing go?
  O1q.village_map.look_old narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Tracing paper over the old map of Olkhovka, with Ilya's garden drawn on it.
  O1q.village_map.look_new narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    The old map of Olkhovka. We gave Ulyana the tracing with the garden.
  O4q.workshop.look narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Ilya's workshop shed, in his yard. Wood shavings spill right to the doorstep.
  O4q.workshop.look_ilya narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Ilya's workshop. A second bench by the door — room for three now.
  O4q.workshop.look_agata narrator  ru           ZAKADR     eleven_v4    Ilya's workshop. We moved the second bench to Dunya's workshop.
